Muzak is the command line for Muzak applications.

Usage:

  muzak <command> [arguments]

The commands are:

  new       create a project laid out the way the framework's example is
  dev       run an application, rebuilding and restarting it when a file changes
  version   print the version of muzak and of the framework it scaffolds
  help      print help about a command

Run "muzak help <command>" for more about a command.
